title:
Plot a pie chart.

# Example: Pie Chart
```JavaScript
PlotAxes.make({
  title: 'Pies'
}).pie({
  x: [40, 30, 15, 10, 5],
  labels: ['Apple', 'Cherry', 'Berry', 'Lemon', 'Key Line'],
  colors: ['green', 'red', 'purple', 'yellow', 'chartreuse'],
  autoPct: '%1.1f%%',
  shadow: true
}).show();
```

# Example: Double Donut Chart
```JavaScript
PlotAxes.make({
  axis: 'equal',
  title: 'Donuts'
}).pie({
  x: [30, 45, 25],
  radius: 1,
  colors: ['#bf4040', '#59bf40', '#4073bf'],
  wedgeProps: {
    width: 0.3,
    edgecolor: 'w'
  },
  labels: ['Cake', 'Regular', 'Buttermilk'],
}).pie({
  x: [20, 10, 25, 20, 15, 10],
  radius: 0.7,
  colors: ['#d98c8c', '#e6b3b3', '#9cd98c', '#bde6b3', '#8cabd9', '#b3c7e6'],
  autoPct: '%.1f%%',
  wedgeProps: {
    width: 0.3,
    edgecolor: 'w'
  }
}).show();
```

